    "id": "pikaday-pickup-keyboard",
    "title": "Keep the current date when the range ends on a closed day",
    "goal": "Weekends are unavailable. Arrow navigation must skip disabled days within the configured min/max range. If no available date remains in that direction, preserve the current valid date. Never clamp onto a disabled boundary or commit a disabled date after the search limit. Preserve the other field and normal pointer selection.",
